                                "sense_id": "e6c286f6-737a-3870-979b-1265cefc41a0",
                                "text": "The discerning customer will appreciate our new range of quality clothing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2260f7a4-71e3-40ab-82eb-cf3851c9110c",
                                "sense_id": "e6c286f6-737a-3870-979b-1265cefc41a0",
                                "text": "Such practices as Theſe, too groſs to lye / Long unobſerv'd by each diſcerning Eye, / The more judicious Iſraelites Unſpell'd, / Though ſtill the Charm the giddy Rabble held, [...]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
